{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56833","headline":"李知遥临化闻空中说偈 · 不详","name":"李知遥临化闻空中说偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"报汝李知遥，成功果自招。\n引君生净土，将尔上金桥。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》四七册宋王日休《龙舒增广净土文集》卷五。\n）（按：李知遥，唐长安人，善净土教。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}